# SDK Package Development Guidelines

## 📦 Package Structure Requirements

### Core Files (Required)
- **`package.json`** - Must follow naming convention `@adobe/react-native-aep{name}`
- **`README.md`** - Package-specific documentation
- **`src/index.ts`** - Main exports file
- **`src/{Name}.ts`** - Primary implementation
- **`RCT{Name}.podspec`** - iOS CocoaPods specification

### Package.json Standards
```json
{
  "name": "@adobe/react-native-aep{name}",
  "version": "7.0.0",
  "description": "Adobe Experience Platform {description}",
  "homepage": "https://developer.adobe.com/client-sdks/documentation/",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts"
}
```

## 🏗️ Implementation Patterns

### Main Export Pattern (`src/index.ts`)
```typescript
// Always include Adobe license header
import MainClass from './{Name}';
import { Model1, Model2 } from './models/{Model}';

export default MainClass;
export { Model1, Model2 };
export * from './models/Types';
```

### Native Module Pattern
```typescript
// Standard React Native module pattern
import { NativeModules } from 'react-native';

const { RCTAEPModuleName } = NativeModules;

class ModuleName {
  static async someMethod(param: string): Promise<Type> {
    return RCTAEPModuleName.someMethod(param);
  }
}

export default ModuleName;
```

## 🧪 Testing Requirements

### Test Structure
- Tests must be in `__tests__/` directory
- Use naming pattern: `{Name}Tests.ts` or `{Name}.spec.ts`
- Mock `NativeModules` in tests:

```typescript
import { NativeModules } from 'react-native';

jest.mock('react-native', () => ({
  NativeModules: {
    RCTAEPModuleName: {
      methodName: jest.fn(),
    },
  },
}));
```

## 🎯 Native Platform Guidelines

### Android (`android/`)
- Follow Gradle build patterns from existing packages
- Use consistent package naming: `com.adobe.marketing.mobile.reactnative`
- Implement proper error handling

### iOS (`ios/`)
- Use Objective-C or Swift for implementation
- Follow CocoaPods specification patterns
- Implement proper bridge methods

## 📋 Common Models Location
Place shared models in `src/models/` directory:
- Type definitions
- Enums
- Interfaces
- Constants

Example: [packages/core/src/models/](mdc:packages/core/src/models/)
